@Vigiloom.Web_HostAddress = http://localhost:5000

### Requires a signed-in monitoring user or an authorized monitoring API credential.
GET {{Vigiloom.Web_HostAddress}}/api/v1/agent-packages?page=1
Accept: application/json

### Cache an eligible package on this Web node; requires Administrator session and antiforgery token.
POST {{Vigiloom.Web_HostAddress}}/api/v1/agent-packages/{{PackageId}}/cache
RequestVerificationToken: {{AntiforgeryToken}}

### Invalid page
GET {{Vigiloom.Web_HostAddress}}/api/v1/agent-packages?page=0
Accept: application/json

### Requires HTTPS and a registered Agent credential.
GET {{Vigiloom.Web_HostAddress}}/api/v1/agent/update/metadata/timestamp.json
Authorization: Bearer {{AgentCredential}}

### Administrator session required; no credential is returned.
GET {{Vigiloom.Web_HostAddress}}/api/v1/agent-management/package-source/

### Read the accepted root fingerprint. Initialization requires the independently authenticated root and fingerprint.
GET {{Vigiloom.Web_HostAddress}}/api/v1/agent-management/package-source/trust

### The PUT and refresh POST also require the session antiforgery token.
PUT {{Vigiloom.Web_HostAddress}}/api/v1/agent-management/package-source/
Content-Type: application/json
RequestVerificationToken: {{AntiforgeryToken}}

{"baseUri":"https://packages.example.test/","credentialAction":0,"credential":null,"version":""}

### Refresh signed catalogue
POST {{Vigiloom.Web_HostAddress}}/api/v1/agent-management/package-source/refresh
RequestVerificationToken: {{AntiforgeryToken}}
